# {{name}}

MCP App scaffolded with `mountly-mcp create` (vanilla: no framework).

## Runbook

```bash
pnpm install
pnpm dev
pnpm verify
pnpm verify:render
```

| File | Role |
| --- | --- |
| `src/view.ts` | `publishMcpView`: `mount` / `update` / `unmount` |
| `server.mjs` | `registerMcpApps` factory |
| `mcp.fixtures.json` | Tool args for `dev --server` |

## Open in a real host

`serve-stdio.mjs` is included. Register that command in Claude Desktop / VS Code / ChatGPT.

## CI

```bash
pnpm exec mountly-mcp build
pnpm exec playwright install chromium
pnpm exec mountly-mcp verify --strict --render
```

## Add another View

```bash
pnpm exec mountly-mcp add settings --framework vanilla
```
